        "original_id": "b5cb6d9a-0a36-5649-8fb3-d2b78f06b539",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Albums: All That Led Us Here, The Invisible, My Animal\n- Events: European tour, Mercury Prize, iTunes Album of the Year critics choice\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, My Animal was released as the debut album by the American rock band Boy Hits Car.\n- On 9 March 2009, The Invisible released their self-titled debut album The Invisible.\n- In 2009, The Invisible album was nominated for the Mercury Prize and was selected as iTunes critics choice for album of the year.\n- In May 2014, Boy Hits Car released All That Led Us Here as their fifth studio album.\n- After releasing All That Led Us Here in May 2014, Boy Hits Car followed it with a European tour.",
